From c5ec0f53bfeea219f5e934dfc192545b373c83a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiruba <koko0909e@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 05:16:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Text spacing, shrink-to-fit and line gradients; black/white
 colors

- UIText letterSpacing, lineSpacing (measured and drawn, also for text
  animation), shrinkToFit (scale the font down until the text fits) and
  a per-line top/bottom gradient.
- Widget blackWhiteEnabled / blackColor / whiteColor: map a widget's own
  drawing from black..white to two colors (LayoutEditor's color
  interpolation) through a built-in UI shader. The shader stack now keeps
  the parameters per entry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
